   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "WHAT IT OWNS\n\u2022 Turning a command line into a running mode (watch / sidecar / sidecars) or a\n  one-shot read (status / analyze / report / enrich).\n\u2022 Starting the background threads and shutting them down: SIGTERM/SIGINT set a\n  stop flag; `finally` clears live_sessions and stops every tcpdump.\nREAD THIS FIRST\n\u2022 Every background thread opens its OWN SQLite connection - a shared connection\n  once made the enrich thread die silently (see TODO.md).\n\u2022 Each loop iteration is wrapped in try/except so a bug is logged and retried,\n  never a silently dead thread.",
   "originalText": "WHAT IT OWNS\n\u2022 Turning a command line into a running mode (watch / sidecar / sidecars) or a\n  one-shot read (status / analyze / report / enrich).\n\u2022 Starting the background threads and shutting them down: SIGTERM/SIGINT set a\n  stop flag; `finally` clears live_sessions and stops every tcpdump.\nREAD THIS FIRST\n\u2022 Every background thread opens its OWN SQLite connection - a shared connection\n  once made the enrich thread die silently (see TODO.md).\n\u2022 Each loop iteration is wrapped in try/except so a bug is logged and retried,\n  never a silently dead thread.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "hld-rectangle-10",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
