   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "KEY IDEA\n\u2022 The host-side veth is the only door in or out of a container, so tcpdump on it\n  sees host, container-to-container and internet traffic.\n\u2022 Nothing is installed in the target image: nettap enters its netns with the\n  host's nsenter.\nGOTCHAS\n\u2022 Not /sys/class/net/eth0/iflink: under nsenter --net sysfs still shows the\n  host's interfaces.\n\u2022 sidecar calls this with resolve=False - it already sits in the target's netns.\n  split_by_netns() finds its target and peers by IP.",
   "originalText": "KEY IDEA\n\u2022 The host-side veth is the only door in or out of a container, so tcpdump on it\n  sees host, container-to-container and internet traffic.\n\u2022 Nothing is installed in the target image: nettap enters its netns with the\n  host's nsenter.\nGOTCHAS\n\u2022 Not /sys/class/net/eth0/iflink: under nsenter --net sysfs still shows the\n  host's interfaces.\n\u2022 sidecar calls this with resolve=False - it already sits in the target's netns.\n  split_by_netns() finds its target and peers by IP.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "hld-rectangle-165",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
